# Frontend monorepo inputs only; Railway owns the Python backend deployment.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!apps/
!apps/web/
!apps/web/**
!packages/
!packages/api-client/
!packages/api-client/**

# Keep local state and credentials out even inside included source directories.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env*
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
